      "side": 1,
      "message": "`ActionFilesCheck` validates only this project\u0027s own files (`maxFiles`, and `ownTextLengthError` over own enabled actions). It never checks `maxEnabledActions`, and the char limit is not the inherited total. `ActionResolver.effective()` enforces both `maxEnabledActions` and `maxTotalChars` over the resolved hierarchy, so a parent can push files within its own limits yet push every descendant\u0027s effective set over the limit, making `GetActions` return 409 for all descendants with no fix the descendant admin can apply. Validate against the effective hierarchy, or document that these limits are not enforced on write.",
      "revId": "49283a4c7ff9b003ef8d1161a946ad9d73b645d9",
